      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable you're looking for relief from cramps and sleep issues. Since you have CKD Stage 2, you must be cautious with supplements, as mineral levels can be tricky. You should absolutely discuss any magnesium supplement dosage with your nephrologist first to ensure it's safe for your specific kidney function. They can provide a personalized recommendation that won't interfere with your treatment.",
      "source": "target",
